self-preservation and avoiding negative consequences.',friends:[t,p,n,f]}],cta:h},{id:'0:0',end_time:b,header_img:o,subtitle:'Who\u2019s in sync with you:',question:'Books or Movies?',answer:0,options:[{text:'Books',emoji:'\ud83d\udcda',color:'#9C82EE',message:'You likely value imagination and depth. You enjoy the process of building a world in your mind and exploring intricate details and internal thoughts.',friends:[]},{text:'Movies',emoji:'\ud83c\udfac',color:'#FF9615',message:'You appreciate visual storytelling and efficiency. You enjoy a well-packaged experience that is emotionally impactful and easy to consume.',friends:[]}],cta:h}]}),3464,[]);
